1	{"goal": "Lakeshore Marathon on Sunday Nov 15. It will be my fourth marathon. My best is 3:41 from two years ago and I want to run 3:30 this time.", "schedule": "I run Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Saturday and Sunday. Monday and Friday are off because of work travel. Weekday runs are early, around 6, before work, so about an hour at most. Saturday is an easy hour and Sunday is the long run. Roughly 6 to 7 hours a week, and more on long-run weeks. I took it easy in June and have been back at about 30 miles a week through July.", "preferences": "Flat paved loops and a canal path for most runs, one hillier route on Thursdays. Sunday long run. I like to know why a session is in the plan. I'm happy to run hard on quality days but I want the easy days to be properly easy. Brooks Ghost for daily miles, Saucony Endorphin Speed for workouts.", "injuries_constraints": "Nothing right now. I had shin splints in my first marathon block, so I tend to ramp up carefully. I can't move the Monday and Friday rest days, and I travel for work about one week in six."}	2026-08-03 11:00:00+00	2026-08-03 11:00:00+00
\.


